  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven : 152 + 8 × 16 ÷ 9 – 4 = 309\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs :\n\nOption 1): ÷ and -\n\n152 + 8 × 16 ÷ 9 – 4 = 309 ⇒ 152 + 8 × 16 - 9 ÷ 4 = 309\n\n152 + 8 × 16 - __**9 **____**÷**____** 4**__ = 309\n\n152 + __**8 × 16**__ - 2.25 = 309\n\n__**152 + 128**__ - 2.25 = 309\n\n__**280 - 2.25**__ = 309\n\n277.75 ≠ 309 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2): ÷ and +\n\n152 + 8 × 16 ÷ 9 – 4 = 309 ⇒ 152 ÷ 8 × 16 + 9 – 4 = 309\n\n__**152 ÷**____** 8**__ × 16 + 9 – 4 = 309\n\n__**19 × 16**__ + 9 – 4 = 309\n\n__**304 + 9**__ - 4 = 309\n\n__**313 - 4**__ = 309\n\n**309 = 309 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3): - and +\n\n152 + 8 × 16 ÷ 9 – 4 = 309 ⇒ 152 - 8 × 16 ÷ 9 + 4 = 309\n\n152 - 8 × __**16 ÷ 9**__ + 4 = 309\n\n152 - __**8 × 1.78**__ + 4 = 309\n\n__**152 + 4**__ - 14.24 = 309\n\n__**156 - 14.24**__ = 309\n\n141.76 ≠ 309 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4): + and ×\n\n152 + 8 × 16 ÷ 9 – 4 = 309 ⇒ 152 × 8 + 16 ÷ 9 – 4 = 309\n\n152 × 8 + __**16 ÷ 9**__ – 4 = 309\n\n__**152 × 8**__ + 1.78 – 4 = 309\n\n__**1216 + 1.78**__ - 4 = 309\n\n__**1217.78 - 4**__ = 309\n\n1213.78 ≠ 309 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
